    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the algorithm thing, but it feels more specific than that. like, it's not just about engagement, it feels like it's targeting a very specific group of people—people who are observant or maybe a bit skeptical. when i see these patterns, it's like they're checking to see how much we'll just accept something without questioning it. can u look into if there are any actual psychological studies or frameworks about using viral trends to measure social compliance or \"nudging\" certain demographics?",
